{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47088","headline":"江上秋思 · 尚颜","name":"江上秋思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"到来江上久，谁念旅游心。\n故国无秋信，邻家有夜砧。\n坐遥翻不睡，愁极却成吟。\n即恐髭连鬓，还爲白所侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尚颜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}